@startuml
title Online Quiz System State Machine

state "Registered User" as RegisteredUser
state "Teacher" as Teacher
state "Student" as Student
state "Quiz Available" as QuizAvailable
state "Quiz Answered" as QuizAnswered
state "Quiz Submitted" as QuizSubmitted
state "Quiz Results" as QuizResults
state "Quiz Draft" as QuizDraft
state "Quiz Edited" as QuizEdited

[*] --> RegisteredUser

RegisteredUser --> Teacher : Register/Login, Continue as Teacher
RegisteredUser --> Student : Register/Login, Continue as Student
Teacher --> CreateNewQuiz : Create New Quiz
Teacher --> EditExistingQuiz : Edit Existing Quiz
Teacher --> SaveDraft : Save Draft
Teacher --> PostQuiz : Post Quiz
Teacher --> ViewResults : View Quiz Results
Student --> QuizAvailable : Select Quiz
Student --> QuizAnswered : Answer Questions
Student --> QuizSubmitted : Submit Quiz
QuizAnswered --> QuizSubmitted : Submit Quiz
QuizSubmitted --> QuizResults : Submit Quiz

Teacher --> QuizDraft : Create New Quiz, Edit Existing Quiz
Teacher --> QuizEdited : Save Draft

QuizResults --> [*] : View Results

@enduml
